OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMostly cloudy with scattered
OL,6,Fshowers, perhaps some longer spells of
OL,7,Frain across Argyll. Best of the
OL,8,Fsunshine across the south. Windy with
OL,9,Ffresh to strong westerly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will see
OL,12,Fshowers, most frequent across Argyll.
OL,13,FThen showers becoming fewer and
OL,14,Flighter during the early hours. Strong
OL,15,Fwesterly winds easing down overnight.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FAfter a dry start rain will
OL,18,Fspread east from late morning and
OL,19,Fduring the afternoon. Rain turning
OL,20,Flight and patchy by evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
