OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FBright
OL,6,Fand windy with a few showers on
OL,7,FMonday, strong westerly winds. Dry for
OL,8,Fmost of Sunday, rain likely later.
OL,9,FEarly rain on Monday then dry.
